    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "## Summary\n- Replace the SaaS-style start copy with a short introduction centered on people, conflict, personal choices, and consequences.\n- Replace the comparison presentation in the existing essence modal with three concise explanatory blocks and a single \"Вернуться\" action.\n- Align visible title and action copy across boomer, genX, millennial, zoomer, and alpha profiles while preserving profile styling and existing start/resume behavior.\n- Keep source and `docs/**` mirrors aligned for changed assets and bump resource versions for cache busting.\n\n## Validation\n- `python3 tools/test_stage7_essence_modal.py`\n- `python3 tools/test_stage7_essence_prestart_overlay.py`\n- `python3 tools/test_stage6_step9_five_profile_runtime_defects.py`\n- `python3 tools/test_stage6_step9_profile_bootstrap_findings.py`\n- `node --check` on modified JavaScript and `git diff --check`\n- In-app Codex Browser: all five profile variants, keyboard and mouse modal opening, Escape/X/Return closing, focus restore and tab trap, start with nickname/year, reload continuation, mobile widths 375px and 320px, no horizontal overflow, low-height modal scroll, valid ARIA targets.\n\nNo gameplay mechanics or onboarding events were changed. Safari acceptance remains for the post-merge user check.",
